#: ../../source/punycode_README.md:3
msgid ""
"Punycode.js is a robust Punycode converter that fully complies to [RFC "
"3492](https://tools.ietf.org/html/rfc3492) and [RFC "
"5891](https://tools.ietf.org/html/rfc5891)."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/punycode_README.md:5
msgid ""
"This JavaScript library is the result of comparing, optimizing and "
"documenting different open-source implementations of the Punycode "
"algorithm:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/punycode_README.md:7
msgid ""
"[The C example code from RFC "
"3492](https://tools.ietf.org/html/rfc3492#appendix-C)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/punycode_README.md:8
msgid ""
"[`punycode.c` by _Markus W. Scherer_ "
"(IBM)](http://opensource.apple.com/source/ICU/ICU-400.42/icuSources/common/punycode.c)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/punycode_README.md:9
msgid ""
"[`punycode.c` by _Ben "
"Noordhuis_](https://github.com/bnoordhuis/punycode/blob/master/punycode.c)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/punycode_README.md:10
msgid ""
"[JavaScript implementation by "
"_some_](http://stackoverflow.com/questions/183485/can-anyone-recommend-a"
"-good-free-javascript-for-punycode-to-unicode-conversion/301287#301287)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/punycode_README.md:11
msgid ""
"[`punycode.js` by _Ben "
"Noordhuis_](https://github.com/joyent/node/blob/426298c8c1c0d5b5224ac3658c41e7c2a3fe9377/lib/punycode.js)"
" (note: [not fully "
"compliant](https://github.com/joyent/node/issues/2072))"
